note The context: the surface and the pipeline, the font and its atlas, and the three vectors a frame accumulates into - vertices, indices and the clip commands that slice them. The app sets shot to a file name to have the next frame also written there as a PNG. Reused buffers hang off it so a steady frame allocates nothing on the GPU.

