file src/gfx.rs
symbol alloc
lines 0 14
hash 258f81e5e731e913
note Shelf allocation: fill a row left to right, start a new row when it does not fit, fail when the atlas is full. Every slot is one texel wider and taller than asked, a margin so filtering never bleeds into a neighbour. No packing, no freeing - a glyph is never evicted, and the whole atlas is thrown away instead when it fills.

